(text "Rockchip tablet reference pp15/24; HW Guide V1.2 sections 2.2.2.9 / 2.2.2.10.\n100nF capacitors under U1; 4.7uF and filtered-rail bulk close to U1. USB filters include 1uF on each side.\nFB550/551: 0.05 ohm maximum initial DCR; 0.10 ohm after qualification tests. Peak DC drops: 1mV / 6mV at 0.10 ohm." (at 15.24 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c7f2a381-e5c7-5573-b640-3364cf7d86dc"))
